Provisional licensing notice for combatrefql

This repository contains newly written R-package wrapper code and
upstream-derived statistical code adapted from the ComBat-ref research
implementation.

No explicit upstream license for the original ComBat-ref repository was found
during local inspection of this checkout or the upstream GitHub repository file
listing. Redistribution terms for upstream-derived code therefore require manual
clarification before public release.

